# MadGraph commands for tc_signal: mu+ mu- -> t cbar + tbar c through O_lequ^(1)
# (coefficient clequ1Re2232 = 1, Lambda = 1 TeV, one insertion), as in
# mucoll-production configs/processes/signal_processes.py. Top and W decays are
# left to Pythia. {MODEL} is replaced by the job's own copy of the UFO with the
# derived restriction (see process.env). generation/gen_job.py adds the output command.
import model {MODEL}
generate mu+ mu- > t c~ NP=1 @0
add process mu+ mu- > t~ c NP=1 @1
